    "original":"anyadevatānāṃ ca vartulaṃ sapañcāmṛtasugandhaiḥ kṛtvā paścimāsyas teṣu maṇḍaleṣu svahṛdbījamayūkhānītaṃ likhanīyamaṇḍalacakraṃ yathāyogam abjastheṣu candreṣu sūryeṣu vopaveśya pādyādipuraḥsaraṃ saṃpūjya stutvāmṛtam āsvādya dakṣiṇaṃ jānu bhūmau nipātya hūṃjaikaśūcikavajrajihvāyāṃ hūṃ nyasya sadhūpakaṭacchusavyakaro vāmena vajraghaṇṭāṃ vādayan |",
